       Q: The contract lists only 'HumanWellbeing' in priority_order but the raw elicitation ranked all three KPIs (resource_efficiency > operator_fatigue > noise_level); which governs when the optimiser faces a real trade-off — strict lexicographic human-wellbeing first, or the raw rank order with hard constraints as backstop?
