    3. operator_fatigue threshold — temporal scope
       Q: The fatigue limit is 0.40 on a normalised index, but the contract does not specify whether this is a continuous never-exceed ceiling throughout the shift or an acceptable end-of-shift reading — if a worker reaches 0.38 after 6 hours, should the optimiser schedule a lighter task (continuous cap) or is that still acceptable as long as the shift ends at ≤ 0.40?
